    "long_instructions": "## DOM Update\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Let's take a look at what the steps to make a DOM update look like in code. \r\n\r\n#### In this example, we will change the text inside the box when the button is clicked.\r\n \r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/2e8aec64b2c5cd684feae4a7345f7c3a-image-1761933082814.png\" alt=\"sample output with button and textbox\" width=\"550px\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: 0; \">\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Activity Preview\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14pt; margin-top:16px;\">\r\nWatch the video below to see the steps. The video follows the activity on the next level to give you a preview and support. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  },
